{"words": [{"text": "وَقَالَ", "translation": "And said"}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "translation": "to them"}, {"text": "نَبِيُّهُمْ", "translation": "their Prophet"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ءَايَةَ", "translation": "a sign"}, {"text": "مُلْكِهِۦٓ", "translation": "(of) his kingship"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "(is) that"}, {"text": "يَأْتِيَكُمُ", "translation": "will come to you"}, {"text": "ٱلتَّابُوتُ", "translation": "the ark"}, {"text": "فِيهِ", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "سَكِينَةٌۭ", "translation": "(is) tranquility"}, {"text": "مِّن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "رَّبِّكُمْ", "translation": "your Lord"}, {"text": "وَبَقِيَّةٌۭ", "translation": "and a remnant"}, {"text": "مِّمَّا", "translation": "of what"}, {"text": "تَرَكَ", "translation": "(was) left"}, {"text": "ءَالُ", "translation": "(by the) family"}, {"text": "مُوسَىٰ", "translation": "(of) Musa"}, {"text": "وَءَالُ", "translation": "and family"}, {"text": "هَـٰرُونَ", "translation": "(of) Harun"}, {"text": "تَحْمِلُهُ", "translation": "will carry it"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ ۚ", "translation": "the Angels"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "لَـَٔايَةًۭ", "translation": "(is) surely a sign"}, {"text": "لَّكُمْ", "translation": "for you"}, {"text": "إِن", "translation": "if"}, {"text": "كُنتُم", "translation": "you are"}, {"text": "مُّؤْمِنِينَ", "translation": "believers"}], "sahih": "And their prophet said to them, \"Indeed, a sign of his kingship is that the chest will come to you in which is assurance1 from your Lord and a remnant of what the family of Moses and the family of Aaron had left, carried by the angels. Indeed in that is a sign for you, if you are believers.\""}